  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner capacity strengthening in DRR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This training project was hosted by Caritas Australia and was facilitated by a DRR specialist (co-funded by CRS, CAFOD, and Caritas Australia). The training was to focus to community based initiatives on DRR, also known as Community Based Disaster Risk Reduction (CBDRR). By providing participants with hands-on exposure to participatory tools used for DRR initiatives, the project aims to steward good facilitation skills of project staff to empower and engage communities to analyse risks, vulnerabilities and capacities, and plan for how best to address the challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
